n- [ ] merged 状态的 issue 不被 SessionEnd 释放\n- [ ] 后端不可用时不影响原有 merge/reject 流程\n"},"tool_response":{"type":"create","filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\module-d-requirements\\D6-issue-review.md","content":"# D6: 003-9-issue-review 改造\n\n> 创建时间：2026-05-27\n> 模块：claude-tap-plus / 模块 D / D6\n> 简述：merge/reject 后向后端更新最终状态\n\n---\n\n## 目标\n\n在 `003-9-issue-review` 技能中：\n- merge 成功后标记 `merged`\n- reject 后标记 `rejected`\n\n## 改造文件\n\n| 文件 | 操作 |\n|------|------|\n| `.claude/skills/003-9-issue-review/scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh` | **修改** |\n\n## 依赖\n\n- **D0**: 需要 `source backend.sh`（`update_issue_status`）\n- **后端 API**: `/api/issue/status`\n\n## 改造内容\n\n```bash\nsource \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/backend.sh\"\n\n# merge 分支\nmerge_issue() {\n  local issue_num=\"$1\"\n\n  # 原有逻辑：gh pr merge ...\n\n  # [新增] 更新后端状态\n  update_issue_status \"$issue_num\" \"merged\"\n}\n\n# reject 分支\nreject_issue() {\n  local issue_num=\"$1\"\n\n  # 原有逻辑：gh pr comment ... gh issue edit ...\n\n  # [新增] 更新后端状态\n  update_issue_status \"$issue_num\" \"rejected\"\n}\n```\n\n## 传入后端的数据\n\nmerge 时：\n```json\n{\n  \"repo_full_name\": \"xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\",\n  \"issue_number\": 10,\n  \"session_id\": \"bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\",\n  \"status\": \"merged\"\n}\n```\n\nreject 时：\n```json\n{\n  \"repo_full_name\": \"xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\",\n  \"issue_number\": 10,\n  \"session_id\": \"bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\",\n  \"status\": \"rejected\"\n}\n```\n\n## 降级行为\n\n后端不可用时静默忽略，继续原有流程。\n\n## 验证标准\n\n- [ ] merge 后后端 issue 状态变为 `merged`\n- [ ] reject 后后端 issue 状态变为 `rejected`\n- [ ] rejected 状态的 issue 被 SessionEnd 释放后可重新 claim\n- [ ] merged 状态的 issue 不被 SessionEnd 释放\n- [ ] 后端不可用时不影响原有 merge/reject 流程\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_d5d67b4c67b545bdae289b40","duration_ms":7}
