[2026-05-27 21:19:03] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"38331d79-b841-49b8-a5e3-a7ad04c2201b","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\38331d79-b841-49b8-a5e3-a7ad04c2201b.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md","old_string":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：合并或打回后\n\n```bash\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```","new_string":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：审核开始时标记 `reviewing`，合并或打回后标记终态\n\n```bash\n# 新增：审核开始时先标记 reviewing\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"reviewing\"\n\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```","replace_all":false},"tool_response":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md","oldString":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：合并或打回后\n\n```bash\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```","newString":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：审核开始时标记 `reviewing`，合并或打回后标记终态\n\n```bash\n# 新增：审核开始时先标记 reviewing\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"reviewing\"\n\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```","originalFile":"# B6-2: 003-5 ~ 003-9 技能改造\n\n> 创建时间：2026-05-27\n> 模块：claude-tap-plus / Issue 管理 / 技能改造\n> 简述：改造 issue-fix 到 issue-review 五个技能，在关键节点调用后端状态流转 API\n\n---\n\n## 需求描述\n\n在 003-5 至 003-9 五个技能的关键操作后，增加调用 `POST /api/issue/status` 更新后端状态。\n\n## 改造总览\n\n| 技能 | 关键操作 | 新增后端调用 | status 值 |\n|------|----------|-------------|-----------|\n| 003-5-issue-fix | 创建分支后 | POST /api/issue/status | `fixing` |\n| 003-6-issue-done | 标记完成后 | POST /api/issue/status | `ready-for-pr` |\n| 003-7-issue-pr | PR 创建后 | POST /api/issue/status | `pr-created` |\n| 003-8-issue-test | 开始测试 | POST /api/issue/status | `testing` |\n| 003-9-issue-review | 合并/打回后 | POST /api/issue/status | `merged` / `rejected` |\n\n## 通用后端调用函数\n\n各技能脚本共用：\n\n```bash\nupdate_issue_status() {\n  local issue_number=\"$1\"\n  local status=\"$2\"\n  local backend_url\n  backend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null \\\n    | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)\n  [ -z \"$backend_url\" ] && return 0\n\n  local session_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\n  local repo=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n\n  curl -s -X POST \"$backend_url/api/issue/status\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\n      \\\"repo_full_name\\\":\\\"$repo\\\",\n      \\\"issue_number\\\":$issue_number,\n      \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$session_id\\\",\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"$status\\\"\n    }\" > /dev/null 2>&1\n}\n```\n\n## 各技能具体改动\n\n### 003-5-issue-fix\n\n**位置**：创建分支成功后\n\n```bash\n# 现有：创建分支\ngit checkout -b $BRANCH_NAME\n\n# 新增：更新后端状态\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"fixing\"\n\n# 现有：gh issue comment\ngh issue comment $ISSUE_NUM --body \"开始开发，分支: $BRANCH_NAME\"\n```\n\n### 003-6-issue-done\n\n**位置**：开发完成标记后\n\n```bash\n# 新增：先更新后端状态\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"ready-for-pr\"\n\n# 现有：更新 GitHub labels\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"ready-for-pr\"\n```\n\n### 003-7-issue-pr\n\n**位置**：PR 创建成功后\n\n```bash\n# 现有：创建 PR\npr_url=$(gh pr create ...)\n\n# 新增：更新后端状态\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"pr-created\"\n```\n\n### 003-8-issue-test\n\n**位置**：开始执行 Test Plan 时\n\n```bash\n# 新增：更新后端状态\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"testing\"\n\n# 现有：执行测试项\n```\n\n### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：合并或打回后\n\n```bash\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```\n\n## 降级策略\n\n后端调用失败不影响技能主流程。`update_issue_status` 失败时静默跳过（`> /dev/null 2>&1`），GitHub 操作照常执行。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 每个技能在关键节点调用正确的 status 值\n- [ ] 后端不可用时不影响技能主流程\n- [ ] 后端可用时状态正确流转\n- [ ] session_id 正确传入\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":101,"oldLines":9,"newStart":101,"newLines":12,"lines":[" "," ### 003-9-issue-review"," ","-**位置**：合并或打回后","+**位置**：审核开始时标记 `reviewing`，合并或打回后标记终态"," "," ```bash","+# 新增：审核开始时先标记 reviewing","+update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"reviewing\"","+"," if [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then","   # 现有：合并","   gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_acf529e145b9415d870d84de","duration_ms":8}
