[2026-05-27 21:19:05] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"38331d79-b841-49b8-a5e3-a7ad04c2201b","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\38331d79-b841-49b8-a5e3-a7ad04c2201b.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md","old_string":"| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","new_string":"| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | — |\n| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","replace_all":false},"tool_response":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md","oldString":"| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","newString":"| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | — |\n| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","originalFile":"# B4: 状态流转 API\n\n> 创建时间：2026-05-27\n> 模块：claude-tap-plus / Issue 管理\n> 简述：实现 `/api/issue/status` 接口，支持技能脚本驱动 issue 状态在各阶段间流转\n\n---\n\n## 需求描述\n\n提供状态更新接口，供 003-5 至 003-9 各技能在对应阶段调用，更新 issue 在后端的状态。后端只记录状态变更，不主动操作 GitHub。\n\n## API 定义\n\n**端点**: `POST /api/issue/status`\n\n### 请求\n\n```json\n{\n  \"repo_full_name\": \"xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\",\n  \"issue_number\": 10,\n  \"session_id\": \"bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\",\n  \"status\": \"fixing\"\n}\n```\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| repo_full_name | string | 是 | 仓库全名 |\n| issue_number | int | 是 | Issue 编号 |\n| session_id | string | 是 | 当前会话 ID |\n| status | string | 是 | 目标状态 |\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\"success\": true, \"status\": \"fixing\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-26T11:00:00Z\"}\n```\n\n### 失败响应（无权限）\n\n```json\n{\"success\": false, \"error\": \"not_owner\", \"message\": \"Issue is owned by session_abc\"}\n```\n\n### 失败响应（非法流转）\n\n```json\n{\"success\": false, \"error\": \"invalid_transition\", \"message\": \"Cannot transition from merged to fixing\"}\n```\n\n## 各技能调用映射\n\n| 技能 | 调用时机 | status 值 | GitHub 同步操作 |\n|------|----------|-----------|----------------|\n| 003-5-issue-fix | 创建分支后 | `fixing` | gh issue comment |\n| 003-6-issue-done | 开发完成后 | `ready-for-pr` | gh issue edit --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"ready-for-pr\" |\n| 003-7-issue-pr | PR 创建后 | `pr-created` | — |\n| 003-8-issue-test | 开始测试 | `testing` | — |\n| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |\n\n## 合法状态流转\n\n```\nidle → claimed        (仅通过 claim API)\nclaimed → fixing\nfixing → ready-for-pr\nfixing → claimed      (reject 回退)\nready-for-pr → pr-created\npr-created → testing\ntesting → reviewing\nreviewing → merged    (终态)\nreviewing → fixing    (reject 回退)\n```\n\n> **注意**：是否严格校验流转路径可选。初期可不校验，仅记录状态；后期按需加入校验。\n\n## 业务逻辑\n\n```\n1. 校验请求参数\n2. 查询 issue_claims 表\n3. 检查权限：session_id 必须是当前领取者（或管理员可强制更新）\n4. （可选）校验状态流转合法性\n5. UPDATE status 和 updated_at\n6. 返回结果\n```\n\n## 技能脚本调用示例\n\n```bash\n# 003-5-issue-fix 中\nsession_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\nrepo=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"$backend_url/api/issue/status\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"repo_full_name\\\":\\\"$repo\\\",\n    \\\"issue_number\\\":$ISSUE_NUM,\n    \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$session_id\\\",\n    \\\"status\\\":\\\"fixing\\\"\n  }\"\n```\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 合法状态可成功更新\n- [ ] 非领取者 session 无法更新状态（返回 not_owner）\n- [ ] （可选）非法状态流转返回 invalid_transition\n- [ ] updated_at 自动更新\n- [ ] 不存在的 issue 返回错误\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":58,"oldLines":6,"newStart":58,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | 003-6-issue-done | 开发完成后 | `ready-for-pr` | gh issue edit --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"ready-for-pr\" |"," | 003-7-issue-pr | PR 创建后 | `pr-created` | — |"," | 003-8-issue-test | 开始测试 | `testing` | — |","+| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | — |"," | 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |"," | 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_abe19f8928754d47ad392437","duration_ms":9}
