me":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\00-overview.md","old_string":"## 实现顺序建议\n\n```\nB1 (数据库) → B2 (查询) + B3 (领取) + B4 (状态) + B5 (释放) → B6 (技能改造)\n```\n\nB1 是基础，B2-B5 可并行开发，B6 依赖全部 API 就绪后改造技能脚本。","new_string":"## 实现顺序建议\n\n```\nB1 (数据库) + B7 (公共模块/服务启动) → B2 (查询) + B3 (领取) + B4 (状态) + B5 (释放) → B6 (技能改造)\n                                                                                          B8 (降级策略，可与 B6 同步)\n```\n\nB1 和 B7 是基础，B2-B5 可并行开发，B6 依赖全部 API 和公共模块就绪。B8 贯穿所有 API 的降级设计，可与 B6 同步完善。\n\n## 关于 `CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` 环境变量\n\n技能脚本统一使用 `json_get '.session_id'` 获取 session_id，**不要求**模块 C（代理侧）注入 `CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` 环境变量。`backend.sh` 的 `_get_session_id()` 预留了环境变量优先路径，如后续模块 C 支持注入，无需修改技能脚本。"},"tool_use_id":"call_f5687298aa07481faaa9c89e","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\00-overview.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md","old_string":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：合并或打回后\n\n```bash\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```","new_string":"### 003-9-issue-review\n\n**位置**：审核开始时标记 `reviewing`，合并或打回后标记终态\n\n```bash\n# 新增：审核开始时先标记 reviewing\nupdate_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"reviewing\"\n\nif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"merge\" ]; then\n  # 现有：合并\n  gh pr merge $PR_NUM --merge\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"merged\"\nelif [ \"$ACTION\" = \"reject\" ]; then\n  # 现有：打回\n  gh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"rejected\"\n  # 新增\n  update_issue_status \"$ISSUE_NUM\" \"rejected\"\nfi\n```"},"tool_use_id":"call_acf529e145b9415d870d84de","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md","old_string":"| 003-9-issue-review | 合并/打回后 | POST /api/issue/status | `merged` / `rejected` |","new_string":"| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | POST /api/issue/status | `reviewing` |\n| 003-9-issue-review | 合并/打回后 | POST /api/issue/status | `merged` / `rejected` |"},"tool_use_id":"call_4a77b1d84aaa44ae9b5ebb4b","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\skill-refactor\\fix-to-review-skills.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md","old_string":"| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","new_string":"| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | — |\n| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |\n| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |"},"tool_use_id":"call_abe19f8928754d47ad392437","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md has been u