[2026-05-27 21:27:37] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"7eb7548c-a726-48fd-98bd-ed5f1719fe2e","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\7eb7548c-a726-48fd-98bd-ed5f1719fe2e.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\module-d-requirements\\00-overview.md","old_string":"## 设计原则\n\n1. **后端优先，GitHub 次之**：状态变更先调后端，再操作 GitHub\n2. **最小侵入改造**：现有流程不变，只在关键节点插入后端调用\n3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为\n4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用\n\n## 整体架构","new_string":"## 设计原则\n\n1. **后端优先，GitHub 次之**：状态变更先调后端，再操作 GitHub\n2. **最小侵入改造**：现有流程不变，只在关键节点插入后端调用\n3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为\n4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用\n\n## Issue 工作流调用链\n\n```\n003-2-issue (创建) → 003-3-issue-discuss (讨论)\n                           ↓\n              003-4-issue-claim (领取) ←──┐\n                           ↓              │\n              003-5-issue-fix (开发)       │\n                           ↓              │ 拒绝后重新领取\n              003-6-issue-done (完成)      │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-7-issue-pr (提PR)        │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-8-issue-test (测试)      │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-9-issue-review (审核) ───┘\n                           ↓\n                     merged / rejected\n```\n\n> 003-2 和 003-3 不需要后端介入（创建新 issue 无冲突，讨论只读/评论不改变状态）。\n\n## 各技能现状与后端介入点\n\n| 技能 | 当前 GitHub 操作 | 需要后端介入 | 介入环节 |\n|------|------------------|-------------|----------|\n| 003-2-issue | `gh issue create` | 否 | — |\n| 003-3-issue-discuss | `gh issue view`, `gh issue comment` | 否 | — |\n| 003-4-issue-claim | `gh issue list` → `gh issue edit --add-assignee` | **是** | list 后去重，edit 前原子领取 |\n| 003-5-issue-fix | `gh issue view` → `git checkout -b` → `gh issue comment` | **是** | 标记 fixing 状态 |\n| 003-6-issue-done | `git status` → `gh issue edit` (改 label) | **是** | 标记 ready-for-pr 状态 |\n| 003-7-issue-pr | `gh pr create` | **是** | 标记 pr-created 状态 |\n| 003-8-issue-test | `gh pr view` → 测试 → `gh pr edit` | **是** | 标记 testing 状态 |\n| 003-9-issue-review | `gh pr merge` / `gh issue edit` | **是** | 标记 merged/rejected 状态 |\n\n## 各技能脚本中已有的数据源\n\n各技能脚本在运行时已可获取以下数据，无需额外参数传递：\n\n```bash\n# 项目信息\nrepo_full_name=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n# → xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\n\n# Issue 信息\nissue_number=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | grep -oE '#[0-9]+' | head -1 | tr -d '#')\n# → 10\n\nissue_title=$(gh issue view \"$issue_number\" --json title --jq '.title')\n# → \"优化 issue 模板\"\n\n# Session 信息（从 hook 环境或请求体）\nsession_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\n# → bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\n\n# 后端地址\nbackend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)\n```\n\n## 各技能需要传入后端的数据汇总\n\n| 技能 | repo_full_name | issue_number | issue_title | session_id | status |\n|------|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|------|\n| D1: 003-4-issue-claim | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | — (claim API 自处理) |\n| D2: 003-5-issue-fix | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `fixing` |\n| D3: 003-6-issue-done | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `ready-for-pr` |\n| D4: 003-7-issue-pr | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `pr-created` |\n| D5: 003-8-issue-test | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `testing` |\n| D6: 003-9-issue-review | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `merged` / `rejected` |\n| D7: SessionEnd | — | — | — | ✓ | — (release-session API 自处理) |\n\n## 整体架构","replace_all":false},"tool_response":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\module-d-requirements\\00-overview.md","oldString":"## 设计原则\n\n1. **后端优先，GitHub 次之**：状态变更先调后端，再操作 GitHub\n2. **最小侵入改造**：现有流程不变，只在关键节点插入后端调用\n3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为\n4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用\n\n## 整体架构","newString":"## 设计原则\n\n1. **后端优先，GitHub 次之**：状态变更先调后端，再操作 GitHub\n2. **最小侵入改造**：现有流程不变，只在关键节点插入后端调用\n3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为\n4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用\n\n## Issue 工作流调用链\n\n```\n003-2-issue (创建) → 003-3-issue-discuss (讨论)\n                           ↓\n              003-4-issue-claim (领取) ←──┐\n                           ↓              │\n              003-5-issue-fix (开发)       │\n                           ↓              │ 拒绝后重新领取\n              003-6-issue-done (完成)      │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-7-issue-pr (提PR)        │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-8-issue-test (测试)      │\n                           ↓              │\n              003-9-issue-review (审核) ───┘\n                           ↓\n                     merged / rejected\n```\n\n> 003-2 和 003-3 不需要后端介入（创建新 issue 无冲突，讨论只读/评论不改变状态）。\n\n## 各技能现状与后端介入点\n\n| 技能 | 当前 GitHub 操作 | 需要后端介入 | 介入环节 |\n|------|------------------|-------------|----------|\n| 003-2-issue | `gh issue create` | 否 | — |\n| 003-3-issue-discuss | `gh issue view`, `gh issue comment` | 否 | — |\n| 003-4-issue-claim | `gh issue list` → `gh issue edit --add-assignee` | **是** | list 后去重，edit 前原子领取 |\n| 003-5-issue-fix | `gh issue view` → `git checkout -b` → `gh issue comment` | **是** | 标记 fixing 状态 |\n| 003-6-issue-done | `git status` → `gh issue edit` (改 label) | **是** | 标记 ready-for-pr 状态 |\n| 003-7-issue-pr | `gh pr create` | **是** | 标记 pr-created 状态 |\n| 003-8-issue-test | `gh pr view` → 测试 → `gh pr edit` | **是** | 标记 testing 状态 |\n| 003-9-issue-review | `gh pr merge` / `gh issue edit` | **是** | 标记 merged/rejected 状态 |\n\n## 各技能脚本中已有的数据源\n\n各技能脚本在运行时已可获取以下数据，无需额外参数传递：\n\n```bash\n# 项目信息\nrepo_full_name=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n# → xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\n\n# Issue 信息\nissue_number=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | grep -oE '#[0-9]+' | head -1 | tr -d '#')\n# → 10\n\nissue_title=$(gh issue view \"$issue_number\" --json title --jq '.title')\n# → \"优化 issue 模板\"\n\n# Session 信息（从 hook 环境或请求体）\nsession_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\n# → bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\n\n# 后端地址\nbackend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)\n```\n\n## 各技能需要传入后端的数据汇总\n\n| 技能 | repo_full_name | issue_number | issue_title | session_id | status |\n|------|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|------|\n| D1: 003-4-issue-claim | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | — (claim API 自处理) |\n| D2: 003-5-issue-fix | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `fixing` |\n| D3: 003-6-issue-done | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `ready-for-pr` |\n| D4: 003-7-issue-pr | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `pr-created` |\n| D5: 003-8-issue-test | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `testing` |\n| D6: 003-9-issue-review | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `merged` / `rejected` |\n| D7: SessionEnd | — | — | — | ✓ | — (release-session API 自处理) |\n\n## 整体架构","originalFile":"# 模块 D 总览：Issue 技能集成后端服务\n\n> 创建时间：2026-05-27\n> 模块：claude-tap-plus / 模块 D\n> 简述：改造 003-x-issue 系列技能，接入后端 Issue 全局管理服务，实现单 GitHub 账号多 Agent 协作\n\n---\n\n## 设计原则\n\n1. **后端优先，GitHub 次之**：状态变更先调后端，再操作 GitHub\n2. **最小侵入改造**：现有流程不变，只在关键节点插入后端调用\n3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为\n4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用\n\n## 整体架构\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     Claude Code 会话                         │\n│                                                              │\n│  003-4-issue-claim ──┐                                       │\n│  003-5-issue-fix     │                                       │\n│  003-6-issue-done    ├──→ 后端调用函数 (backend.sh)          │\n│  003-7-issue-pr      │                                       │\n│  003-8-issue-test    │                                       │\n│  003-9-issue-review ─┘                                       │\n│                          ↓                                   │\n│                   .claude/backend.conf                        │\n│                          ↓                                   │\n│              ┌─────────────────────┐                         │\n│              │ 后端不可用/未配置    │                         │\n│              │ → 降级为原有行为     │                         │\n│              └─────────────────────┘                         │\n└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\n                           │ HTTP (curl)\n                           ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              claude-tap-plus 后端服务器                       │\n│                                                              │\n│  POST /api/issue/check   → 查询 issue 状态                   │\n│  POST /api/issue/claim   → 领取 issue                        │\n│  POST /api/issue/status  → 更新状态                          │\n│  POST /api/issue/release → 释放 issue                        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 后端状态定义\n\n| 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `idle` | 空闲 |\n| `claimed` | 已被领取 |\n| `fixing` | 开发中 |\n| `ready-for-pr` | 开发完成 |\n| `pr-created` | PR 已创建 |\n| `testing` | 测试中 |\n| `reviewing` | 审核中 |\n| `merged` | 已合并 |\n| `rejected` | 被打回 |\n\n## 数据库表（复用模块 B）\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE issue_claims (\n    id              INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n    repo_full_name  TEXT NOT NULL,\n    issue_number    INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    issue_title     TEXT,\n    status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'idle',\n    session_id      TEXT,\n    claimed_at      DATETIME,\n    updated_at      DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n    UNIQUE(repo_full_name, issue_number)\n);\n```\n\n## 子需求依赖关系\n\n```\nD0 (公共基础设施 backend.sh)\n ├── D1 (003-4-issue-claim 改造) — 最复杂，涉及 check + claim\n ├── D2 (003-5-issue-fix 改造) — 状态标记 fixing\n ├── D3 (003-6-issue-done 改造) — 状态标记 ready-for-pr\n ├── D4 (003-7-issue-pr 改造) — 状态标记 pr-created\n ├── D5 (003-8-issue-test 改造) — 状态标记 testing\n ├── D6 (003-9-issue-review 改造) — 状态标记 merged/rejected\n └── D7 (SessionEnd 自动释放) — 会话结束时释放 issue\n```\n\n## 状态写入时序\n\n| 时机 | 操作 | 调用方 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| claim 时 | INSERT OR IGNORE → UPDATE status='claimed' | D1: 003-4-issue-claim |\n| fixing 时 | UPDATE status='fixing' | D2: 003-5-issue-fix |\n| done 时 | UPDATE status='ready-for-pr' | D3: 003-6-issue-done |\n| pr 时 | UPDATE status='pr-created' | D4: 003-7-issue-pr |\n| test 时 | UPDATE status='testing' | D5: 003-8-issue-test |\n| merge 时 | UPDATE status='merged' | D6: 003-9-issue-review |\n| reject 时 | UPDATE status='rejected' | D6: 003-9-issue-review |\n| SessionEnd | UPDATE status='idle' (排除 merged/rejected) | D7: SessionEnd hook |\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":6,"newStart":13,"newLines":77,"lines":[" 3. **失败静默**：后端不可用时降级为原有行为"," 4. **配置驱动**：通过 `.claude/backend.conf` 控制启用"," ","+## Issue 工作流调用链","+","+```","+003-2-issue (创建) → 003-3-issue-discuss (讨论)","+                           ↓","+              003-4-issue-claim (领取) ←──┐","+                           ↓              │","+              003-5-issue-fix (开发)       │","+                           ↓              │ 拒绝后重新领取","+              003-6-issue-done (完成)      │","+                           ↓              │","+              003-7-issue-pr (提PR)        │","+                           ↓              │","+              003-8-issue-test (测试)      │","+                           ↓              │","+              003-9-issue-review (审核) ───┘","+                           ↓","+                     merged / rejected","+```","+","+> 003-2 和 003-3 不需要后端介入（创建新 issue 无冲突，讨论只读/评论不改变状态）。","+","+## 各技能现状与后端介入点","+","+| 技能 | 当前 GitHub 操作 | 需要后端介入 | 介入环节 |","+|------|------------------|-------------|----------|","+| 003-2-issue | `gh issue create` | 否 | — |","+| 003-3-issue-discuss | `gh issue view`, `gh issue comment` | 否 | — |","+| 003-4-issue-claim | `gh issue list` → `gh issue edit --add-assignee` | **是** | list 后去重，edit 前原子领取 |","+| 003-5-issue-fix | `gh issue view` → `git checkout -b` → `gh issue comment` | **是** | 标记 fixing 状态 |","+| 003-6-issue-done | `git status` → `gh issue edit` (改 label) | **是** | 标记 ready-for-pr 状态 |","+| 003-7-issue-pr | `gh pr create` | **是** | 标记 pr-created 状态 |","+| 003-8-issue-test | `gh pr view` → 测试 → `gh pr edit` | **是** | 标记 testing 状态 |","+| 003-9-issue-review | `gh pr merge` / `gh issue edit` | **是** | 标记 merged/rejected 状态 |","+","+## 各技能脚本中已有的数据源","+","+各技能脚本在运行时已可获取以下数据，无需额外参数传递：","+","+```bash","+# 项目信息","+repo_full_name=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')","+# → xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk","+","+# Issue 信息","+issue_number=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | grep -oE '#[0-9]+' | head -1 | tr -d '#')","+# → 10","+","+issue_title=$(gh issue view \"$issue_number\" --json title --jq '.title')","+# → \"优化 issue 模板\"","+","+# Session 信息（从 hook 环境或请求体）","+session_id=$(json_get '.session_id')","+# → bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31","+","+# 后端地址","+backend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)","+```","+","+## 各技能需要传入后端的数据汇总","+","+| 技能 | repo_full_name | issue_number | issue_title | session_id | status |","+|------|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|------|","+| D1: 003-4-issue-claim | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | — (claim API 自处理) |","+| D2: 003-5-issue-fix | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `fixing` |","+| D3: 003-6-issue-done | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `ready-for-pr` |","+| D4: 003-7-issue-pr | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `pr-created` |","+| D5: 003-8-issue-test | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `testing` |","+| D6: 003-9-issue-review | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `merged` / `rejected` |","+| D7: SessionEnd | — | — | — | ✓ | — (release-session API 自处理) |","+"," ## 整体架构"," "," ```"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_01fa4ae3b3c84f6caa562999","duration_ms":31}
