dated_at\n6. 返回结果\n```\n\n## 技能脚本调用示例\n\n```bash\n# 003-5-issue-fix 中\nsession_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\nrepo=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"$backend_url/api/issue/status\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"repo_full_name\\\":\\\"$repo\\\",\n    \\\"issue_number\\\":$ISSUE_NUM,\n    \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$session_id\\\",\n    \\\"status\\\":\\\"fixing\\\"\n  }\"\n```\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 合法状态可成功更新\n- [ ] 非领取者 session 无法更新状态（返回 not_owner）\n- [ ] （可选）非法状态流转返回 invalid_transition\n- [ ] updated_at 自动更新\n- [ ] 不存在的 issue 返回错误\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":61,"oldLines":16,"newStart":61,"newLines":20,"lines":[" "," ## 各技能调用映射"," ","-| 技能 | 调用时机 | status 值 | GitHub 同步操作 |","-|------|----------|-----------|----------------|","-| 003-5-issue-fix | 创建分支后 | `fixing` | gh issue comment |","-| 003-6-issue-done | 开发完成后 | `ready-for-pr` | gh issue edit --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"ready-for-pr\" |","-| 003-7-issue-pr | PR 创建后 | `pr-created` | — |","-| 003-8-issue-test | 开始测试 | `testing` | — |","-| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | — |","-| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | gh issue close |","-| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` | gh issue edit --add-label \"rejected\" |","+`update_issue_status()` 内部自动完成双写：调后端 API + 同步 GitHub label。"," ","+| 技能 | 调用时机 | status 值 | GitHub Label 变更（自动） |","+|------|----------|-----------|--------------------------|","+| 003-5-issue-fix | 创建分支后 | `fixing` | 移除 `in-progress`，添加 `fixing` |","+| 003-6-issue-done | 开发完成后 | `ready-for-pr` | 移除 `fixing`，添加 `ready-for-pr` |","+| 003-7-issue-pr | PR 创建后 | `pr-created` | 移除 `ready-for-pr`，添加 `pr-created` |","+| 003-8-issue-test | 开始测试 | `testing` | 移除 `pr-created`，添加 `testing` |","+| 003-9-issue-review | 审核开始 | `reviewing` | 移除 `testing`，添加 `reviewing` |","+| 003-9-issue-review merge | 合并后 | `merged` | 移除 `reviewing`，关闭 issue |","+| 003-9-issue-review reject | 打回后 | `rejected` |