\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md","old_string":"```\n1. 校验请求参数\n2. 查询 issue_claims 表\n3. 检查权限：session_id 必须是当前领取者（或管理员可强制更新）\n4. （可选）校验状态流转合法性\n5. UPDATE status 和 updated_at\n6. 返回结果\n```","new_string":"```\n1. 校验请求参数\n2. 查询 issue_claims 表，记录当前 status 作为 previous_status\n3. 检查权限：session_id 必须是当前领取者（或管理员可强制更新）\n4. （可选）校验状态流转合法性\n5. UPDATE status 和 updated_at\n6. 返回结果（含 previous_status）\n```"},"tool_use_id":"call_7e82972cca874c039176c8b2","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md","old_string":"- [ ] updated_at 自动更新\n- [ ] 不存在的 issue 返回错误","new_string":"- [ ] updated_at 自动更新\n- [ ] 响应中包含 previous_status 字段\n- [ ] 不存在的 issue 返回错误"},"tool_use_id":"call_fdb9f2769710401aa0367f4e","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-27\\issue-management-reqs\\issue-status-api.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
