"claimed\"\n  log \"INFO\" \"Issue #$ISSUE_NUM claimed successfully\"\nelse\n  echo \"Issue #$ISSUE_NUM 已被其他 session 领取\"\nfi\n```\n\n> claim 时旧状态为 idle（无 label），`_sync_github_label` 只添加 `in-progress`，不移除旧 label。","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"call_00b7cf077c054f11a56406b7"}
