\n\n---\n\n### Inconsistency 16: Backend project structure in 0527, not in 0526\n\n**0527 SR-4 (lines 156-171):** Defines a detailed project directory structure:\n```\nclaude_tap_plus/\n├── cmd/\n│   ├── claude-tap/          # existing proxy CLI\n│   └── claude-tap-server/   # new: backend service CLI\n├── internal/\n│   ├── session/             # existing: session push/pull\n│   ├── backend/             # new: backend service\n│   │   ├── server.go\n│   │   ├── handler.go\n│   │   ├── db.go\n│   │   └── model.go\n```\n\n**0526 file:** Does not specify any backend project directory structure or file layout. Only mentions `trace/writer.go` and hooks scripts.\n\n---\n\n### Inconsistency 17: SR-1 mentions \"当前路径（待确认）\" -- acknowledges uncertainty\n\n**0527 SR-1 (lines 13-15):** States:\n&gt; \"## 当前路径（待确认）\\n&gt; 代理现有的 trace 输出路径（需从 `trace/writer.go` 确认）。\"\n\n**0526 file (section 5.3):** States the current path format matter-of-factly without acknowledging any uncertainty, implying the path is already known to be flat (before restructuring).\n\n---\n\n### Inconsistency 18: `extractProjectSlug()` in Go (SR-1) vs. bash (0526)\n\n**0526 file (section 3.2, lines 119-125):** Provides bash sed commands for extracting identifiers from transcript_path.\n\n**0527 SR-1 (lines 66-72):** Provides a Go function signature `extractProjectSlug(transcriptPath string) string` with description.\n\nThese are for different components (hook uses bash, proxy uses Go), so this is expected and not a contradiction.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of substantive inconsistencies:\n\n| # | Category | 0526 | 0527 | Severity |\n|---|----------|------|------|----------|\n| 1 | trace_path value | Section 4 JSON shows new path; section 5.2 code sends original transcript_path (internal contradiction in 0526) | SR-2/SR-4 consistently send original transcript_path | Medium -- 0526 is self-contradictory; 0527 resolves it |\n| 2 | project_id concept | Defines `project_id = \"{hostname}/{project_slug}\"` in section 3.3 | Completely absent; uses separate `machine_id` + `project_slug` | Medium -- concept dropped without explanation |\n| 4 | /api/issue/* | Listed as backend API endpoint | Completely absent from all 0527 files | Medium -- feature scope reduced without mention |\n| 5 | GET query APIs | Not listed (only register/close/issue) | Adds GET /api/sessions and GET /api/session/:id | Low -- 0527 adds features |\n| 8 | machines table data | Requires hostname, username columns | POST request does not include separate hostname/username; parsing needed from machine_id but not specified | Medium -- implementation gap |\n| 10 | SessionEnd fields | Lists transcript_path, cwd, hook_event_name | Only lists session_id and reason | Low -- 0527 may be deliberately simplifying |\n| 11 | Ctrl+C scenario | Documented with analysis | Absent | Low |\n| 12 | Timeout cleanup SQL | Full SQL provided | Brief mention only | Low -- detail lost |\n| 15 | Backend tech stack | Generic recommendation | Specific: modernc.org/sqlite, gin/net/http | Low -- 0527 adds detail |\n| 16 | Backend project structure | Not specified | Full directory layout with filenames | Low -- 0527 adds detail |\n| 17 | Current trace path certainty | Implied as known | Explicitly marked \"to be confirmed\" | Low -- 0527 is more honest about uncertainty |\n\nThe most impactful inconsistencies are #1 (trace_path internal contradiction in 0526), #2 (project_id concept dropped), #4 (issue APIs dropped), and #8 (machines table data source gap).</result>\n<usage><total_tokens>0</total_tokens><tool_uses>7</tool_uses><duration_ms>93600</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
