\n  claimed_by=$(echo \"$claim_result\" | jq -r '.claimed_by')\n  echo \"Issue #10 已被 $claimed_by 领取\"\nfi\n```\n\n### 5.5 B4: Issue 状态流转\n\n**API**: `POST /api/issue/status`\n\n**请求**：\n```json","numLines":55,"startLine":285,"totalLines":653}},"tool_use_id":"call_770731c46d8f4f1894a13af8","duration_ms":3}
