`~/.claude.json` config files\n  - `client.go`: Defines client-specific settings and target detection\n\n- **`proxy/`**: HTTP reverse proxy implementation\n  - `reverse.go`: Main proxy server with SSE handling\n  - `headers.go`: Header filtering and sensitive data redaction\n  - `paths.go`: API path whitelisting\n  - `netutil.go`: Cross-platform network utilities\n\n- **`session/`**: Session management functionality\n  - `collect.go`: Collect sessions from `.claude/` directory\n  - `restore.go`: Restore sessions back to `.claude/`\n  - `meta.go`: Session metadata structures\n  - `slug.go`: Project slug generation for unique identifiers\n  - `status.go`: Session status reporting\n\n- **`sse/`**: Server-Sent Events handling\n  - `reassembler.go`: Reassembles SSE chunks into complete API responses\n  - `types.go`: SSE type definitions\n\n- **`trace/`**: JSONL trace recording\n  - `writer.go`: Trace writer with token statistics\n  - `anthropic.go`: Anthropic-specific trace handling\n\n- **`usage/`**: Token usage normalization across providers\n  - `normalize.go`: Normalizes token fields for Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini\n  - `anthropic.go`: Anthropic-specific usage handling\n\n### 4. Additional Features\n- **Demo implementation** (`.00demo/`): Python version for comparison/development\n- **Comprehensive test suite** covering all major components\n- **Multi-provider support**: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini API handling\n- **Sensitive data redaction**: API keys and tokens are masked in trace files\n- **Session synchronization**: Can backup/restore Claude sessions between machines\n\nThe project is a sophisticated reverse proxy that intercepts AI coding agent API traffic, records detailed traces, and provides session management capabilities for Claude Code.","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
