g\n\n### 4. Additional Features\n- **Demo implementation** (`.00demo/`): Python version for comparison/development\n- **Comprehensive test suite** covering all major components\n- **Multi-provider support**: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini API handling\n- **Sensitive data redaction**: API keys and tokens are masked in trace files\n- **Session synchronization**: Can backup/restore Claude sessions between machines\n\nThe project is a sophisticated reverse proxy that intercepts AI coding agent API traffic, records detailed traces, and provides session management capabilities for Claude Code."}],"totalDurationMs":130696,"totalTokens":45989,"totalToolUseCount":12,"usage":{"input_tokens":48,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":43916,"output_tokens":2025,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_0361f87e60af46e59945e6de","duration_ms":130697}
